  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "握手与 header 剥离",
      "items": [
        "handleResponses 先判 Upgrade 头，否则 Codex 的 GET 会被 405 拒掉",
        "Sec-WebSocket-Accept = base64(SHA1(key + 固定 GUID))，缺 key 直接 ABORT",
        "转上游前剥离 Upgrade / Connection / Sec-WebSocket-* header"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "首帧保活",
      "items": [
        "Codex 约 10s 无内容即断开，而上游首帧常要 10-35s",
        "心跳固定 event: ping 加 data: {\"type\":\"ping\"}，两路共用同一工厂",
        "SSE 注释 : heartbeat 或空 data 行不算内容活动，不重置客户端超时"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "帧语义与事件序列",
      "items": [
        "一个 SSE chunk 封装成一条 WS text frame，不合并",
        "created → output_item.added → output_text.delta* → output_item.done → response.completed",
        "ctx.Done() 时也必须补发 output_item.done 加 response.completed"
      ]
    }
  ]
